---

<section id="science-section" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#fafafa] border-b border-[#ebebeb]">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs uppercase font-medium text-[#171717] bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 shadow-2xs">
        <span class="text-[#7928ca]">04</span> // CLINICAL COMPARISON
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-tight mb-3">
        Why Biological Whole Food Trumps Kibble
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4d4d4d]">
        A side-by-side analysis of biological bioavailability, processing temperatures, and financial transparency.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table Card -->
    <div class="hairline-card overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-[#ebebeb] bg-[#fafafa]">
            <th class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-mono uppercase text-[#8f8f8f] font-semibold">Nutritional Metric</th>
            <th class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-mono uppercase text-[#10b981] font-bold bg-[#10b981]/5">
              ✨ DogFoodPlanner (Fresh/Raw)
            </th>
            <th class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-mono uppercase text-[#8f8f8f] font-semibold">Pre-Pack Subscriptions</th>
            <th class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-mono uppercase text-[#ee0000] font-semibold">Commercial Dry Kibble</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#ebebeb]">
          <tr class="hover:bg-[#fafafa]/80 transition-colors">
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium text-[#171717]">
              Processing Method & Heat
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-semibold text-[#10b981] bg-[#10b981]/5">
              Gently Simmered (160°F) or Raw Living Enzymes
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d]">
              Flash-Frozen Cooked Pouches
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#ee0000]">
              Ultra-High Extrusion (300°F–400°F) creating AGEs
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="hover:bg-[#fafafa]/80 transition-colors">
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium text-[#171717]">
              Starch & Net Carbohydrates
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-semibold text-[#10b981] bg-[#10b981]/5">
              &lt; 3.5% (Natural vegetable fiber only)
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d]">
              10% – 15%
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#ee0000]">
              45% – 60% (High-glycemic grain/potato fillers)
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="hover:bg-[#fafafa]/80 transition-colors">
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium text-[#171717]">
              Biological Moisture
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-semibold text-[#10b981] bg-[#10b981]/5">
              70% – 75% (Essential renal & urinary hydration)
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d]">
              70% – 75%
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#ee0000]">
              8% – 10% (Chronic sub-clinical dehydration)
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="hover:bg-[#fafafa]/80 transition-colors">
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium text-[#171717]">
              Flexibility & Freedom
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-semibold text-[#10b981] bg-[#10b981]/5">
              100% Free Recipe Control (Cook fresh, raw, or 25% topper)
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d]">
              Locked to recurring brand shipments
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d]">
              Locked to commercial pet store bag sizes
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr class="hover:bg-[#fafafa]/80 transition-colors">
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-medium text-[#171717]">
              Average Monthly Cost (45 lb dog)
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 font-bold text-[#171717] bg-[#10b981]/5 font-mono">
              ~$130 - $160 / mo (Save 55%)
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d] font-mono">
              $290 - $380 / mo
            </td>
            <td class="p-4 sm:p-5 text-[#4d4d4d] font-mono">
              $65 - $95 / mo (+ higher vet bills)
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
